            </Array>
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="note_edge" value="&lt;b&gt;Reading the gateway arrow&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;The gateway reaches every service on HTTP :8080 through its route set on gateway.duynh.me: /public and /private for the storefront (customer realm JWT), /protected for the back-office on product, inventory, order, payment, shipping and user (staff realm JWT). Inventory exposes only /protected over HTTP. Every service also verifies tokens itself against Keycloak's JWKS (pkg/authmw), which is not drawn." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=11;fontColor=#475569;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="1005" width="1020" height="70" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="note_scope" value="&lt;b&gt;Elsewhere&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;checkout starts AbandonedCheckoutWorkflow and the order API starts OrderFulfillmentWorkflow and CancellationWorkflow on Temporal; the order worker's calls above are that workflow's activities (workflows/temporal-keda). mockpay posts its webhook to payment in-cluster; the gateway's webhook route is used by local-stack only. Databases and the Valkey cache are databases/topology." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=11;fontColor=#475569;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="1087" width="1020" height="60" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
